    - target: {fileID: 695382096413780981, guid: ed9bcc4b62ee3af4a91911bfaf33a9d1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "In a small place, not so different from here. \nWhere warmth feels
        familiar and hearts are sincere.\nA gentle soul waits with a comforting glow,\nshe
        speaks not in riddles, yet knows what you should know.\nTurn from her whispers,
        follow the dark, \nwhere hot breath lingers and leaves are marked.\nIn a
        quiet clearing, bound by fire, gold rests on a sleeper you should not desire"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
